abstract: >-
  Complete English translation of the original nine-unit O017 / D120 course,
  including 54 exercises, 54 answer guides, teaching and calibration material,
  and an additive bilingual stable-ID backend. Produced with OpenAI Codex
  gpt-5.6-sol, Ultra, at the human creator's instruction. Original expressive
  material is CC BY-SA 4.0; donor content, software, runtime and fonts retain
  separate component licenses. Calibration does not demonstrate real learner
  performance or community participation. The English-additive version
  preserves the inherited Indonesian files in the same concept lineage.
